Data and Privacy
Scope & Core Inquiries: Should users of this company's products feel safe knowing that their private, confidential, personal, or identifying information will not be shared, sold, or compromised? Does the company engage in covert surveillance, persistent location tracking, biometric data harvesting (facial recognition, voiceprints), or keystroke logging without explicit, informed consent? Does it scrape user data, private communications, or intellectual property to train proprietary AI models? Does it sell data to third-party data brokers or facilitate warrantless government surveillance?